NOTES ON THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL

- "Jev" and "System One" are TypeSafe AI's names for their model and model class.
  This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to TypeSafe AI.
  The Jev name is used in the repository title as an affectionate nod, and the
  comparison numbers cited in RESULTS.md are TypeSafe's own published figures,
  quoted with attribution.
- Model weights (MiniCPM5-2B) are OpenBMB's, Apache-2.0, and are downloaded, not
  vendored. This repository contains no model weights.
- JevBench task data and scoring formulas are from fstandhartinger/jevbench. That
  benchmark's public items are used under the terms stated in its own repository;
  check them before redistributing the task text.
